        "title": "居然 + proposition",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "居然 presents an actual situation as unexpectedly surprising. Distinguish surprise from uncertainty about whether it happened.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他居然来了。",
                "pinyin": "tā jūrán lái le 。",
                "meaning": "He actually came, to my surprise.",
                "audio": "fe19989bdeb7925bc6f29c7ac9f05bb17c618619583a2578cb991a3d4d9261a6"
              },
              {
                "text": "我居然忘了他的名字。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ jūrán wàng le tā de míngzi 。",
                "meaning": "I surprisingly forgot his name.",
